/* 사무실 펫 — 치이카와 7종 도트 스프라이트 (원본 이미지 도트 + 24x24 코드 도트 겸용) */
(function (root) {
  const GW = 24;
  const K = { baby: 0.58, child: 0.78, adult: 1 };
  const STAGES = ['baby', 'child', 'adult'];

  function ell(cx, cy, rx, ry) { return (x, y) => ((x - cx) / rx) ** 2 + ((y - cy) / ry) ** 2 <= 1; }
  function rell(cx, cy, rx, ry, a) {
    const c = Math.cos(a), s = Math.sin(a);
    return (x, y) => { const dx = x - cx, dy = y - cy, u = dx * c + dy * s, v = -dx * s + dy * c; return (u / rx) ** 2 + (v / ry) ** 2 <= 1; };
  }

  function makeSprite(layers, post) {
    const g = Array.from({ length: GW }, () => Array(GW).fill(null));
    for (const L of layers) {
      const ins = (x, y) => x >= 0 && y >= 0 && x < GW && y < GW && L.m(x + 0.5, y + 0.5);
      let sx = 0, sy = 0, n = 0;
      for (let y = 0; y < GW; y++) for (let x = 0; x < GW; x++) if (ins(x, y)) { sx += x; sy += y; n++; }
      const cx = sx / (n || 1), cy = sy / (n || 1);
      for (let y = 0; y < GW; y++) for (let x = 0; x < GW; x++) {
        if (!ins(x, y)) continue;
        let c = L.p.b;
        if (!ins(x, y + 1) || !ins(x, y + 2)) c = L.p.s;
        if (!ins(x + 1, y) && x > cx) c = L.p.s;
        if ((!ins(x - 1, y) || !ins(x, y - 1)) && x < cx && y < cy) c = L.p.h;
        g[y][x] = c;
      }
      for (let y = 0; y < GW; y++) for (let x = 0; x < GW; x++) {
        if (!ins(x, y) && (ins(x - 1, y) || ins(x + 1, y) || ins(x, y - 1) || ins(x, y + 1))) g[y][x] = L.p.o;
      }
    }
    if (post) post(g);
    return g;
  }
  const inner = (g, x, y, o) => g[y] && g[y][x] && g[y][x] !== o;

  function face(off, h, ey, my, blushDy, bo) {
    bo = bo == null ? 2 : bo;
    return { eye: { l: 12 - off, r: 10 + off, y: ey, h }, mouth: { x: 11, y: my }, blush: { l: 12 - off - bo, r: 10 + off + bo, y: my + blushDy } };
  }

  // 팔레트 정의
  const P_WHITE = { o: '#2B2325', b: '#FFFFFF', h: '#FFFFFF', s: '#ECEEF2' };
  const P_BLUE  = { o: '#222834', b: '#5294CC', h: '#78B2E3', s: '#3F79AD' };
  const P_USAGI = { o: '#2E241B', b: '#FCECC2', h: '#FFF7DF', s: '#EDD79E' };
  const P_KURI  = { o: '#302118', b: '#FCEAD2', h: '#FFF6E8', s: '#EAD2B3' };
  const P_CHEST = { o: '#302118', b: '#784D36', h: '#916248', s: '#5E3A26' };
  const P_TAIL  = { o: '#242B35', b: '#CBEAF6', h: '#E4F5FC', s: '#A8D4E6' };
  const P_RAKKO = { o: '#2E231B', b: '#FCF3E3', h: '#FFFDF7', s: '#EADBC3' };
  const P_MANE  = { o: '#2E2018', b: '#82563C', h: '#9C6B4E', s: '#66412B' };

  const BUILD = {
    chiikawa(st) {
      const k = K[st], rx = 8.2 * k, ry = 7.4 * k, cy = 22 - ry, top = cy - ry;
      const er = Math.max(1.8, 2.5 * k), ex = 5.2 * k, ey0 = top + 1.2 * k;
      const g = makeSprite([
        { m: ell(12 - ex, ey0, er, er), p: P_WHITE },
        { m: ell(12 + ex, ey0, er, er), p: P_WHITE },
        { m: ell(12, cy, rx, ry), p: P_WHITE }
      ], g => {
        const py = Math.round(ey0), lx = Math.round(12 - ex), rx0 = Math.round(11 + ex);
        if (inner(g, lx, py, P_WHITE.o)) g[py][lx] = '#F4B2B8';
        if (inner(g, rx0, py, P_WHITE.o)) g[py][rx0] = '#F4B2B8';
      });
      const off = st === 'adult' ? 4 : 3, h = st === 'baby' ? 2 : 3, ey = Math.floor(cy) - 1;
      return Object.assign({ g, o: P_WHITE.o }, face(off, h, ey, ey + h + 1, -1, st === 'baby' ? 1 : 2));
    },
    hachiware(st) {
      const k = K[st], rx = 8.2 * k, ry = 7.4 * k, cy = 22 - ry, top = cy - ry;
      const ex = 5.0 * k, ey0 = top + 1.0 * k;
      const g = makeSprite([
        { m: rell(12 - ex, ey0, 2.6 * k, 3.0 * k, -0.35), p: P_BLUE },
        { m: rell(12 + ex, ey0, 2.6 * k, 3.0 * k, 0.35), p: P_BLUE },
        { m: ell(12, cy, rx, ry), p: P_WHITE }
      ], g => {
        // 파란 가르마(하치와레) 무늬
        const yCap = Math.floor(top + 4.2 * k);
        for (let y = Math.max(0, Math.floor(top - 2)); y <= yCap; y++) {
          for (let x = 0; x < GW; x++) {
            if (!inner(g, x, y, P_WHITE.o)) continue;
            const gap = Math.max(0, (y - Math.floor(top + 1.2 * k)) * 1.4);
            if (Math.abs(x - 11.5) >= gap) g[y][x] = y === yCap ? P_BLUE.s : P_BLUE.b;
          }
        }
      });
      const off = st === 'adult' ? 4 : 3, h = st === 'baby' ? 2 : 3, ey = Math.floor(cy) - 1;
      return Object.assign({ g, o: P_WHITE.o }, face(off, h, ey, ey + h + 1, -1, st === 'baby' ? 1 : 2));
    },
    usagi(st) {
      const k = K[st], rx = 7.8 * k, ry = 6.8 * k, cy = 22 - ry, top = cy - ry;
      const ex = 2.5 * k, ey0 = top - 2.6 * k, erx = Math.max(1.5, 1.9 * k), ery = Math.max(2.6, 4.4 * k);
      const g = makeSprite([
        { m: ell(12 - ex, ey0, erx, ery), p: P_USAGI },
        { m: ell(12 + ex, ey0, erx, ery), p: P_USAGI },
        { m: ell(12, cy, rx, ry), p: P_USAGI }
      ], g => {
        const lx = Math.round(12 - ex), rx0 = Math.round(11 + ex);
        for (let y = Math.max(1, Math.floor(ey0 - ery + 2)); y < Math.floor(top + 1); y++) {
          if (inner(g, lx, y, P_USAGI.o)) g[y][lx] = '#F5B0B6';
          if (inner(g, rx0, y, P_USAGI.o)) g[y][rx0] = '#F5B0B6';
        }
      });
      const off = st === 'adult' ? 4 : 3, h = st === 'baby' ? 2 : 3, ey = Math.floor(cy) - 1;
      return Object.assign({ g, o: P_USAGI.o }, face(off, h, ey, ey + h + 1, -1, st === 'baby' ? 1 : 2));
    },
    kurimanju(st) {
      const k = K[st], rx = 8.4 * k, ry = 7.2 * k, cy = 22 - ry, top = cy - ry;
      const ex = 5.8 * k, ey0 = top + 2.2 * k, er = Math.max(1.5, 2.0 * k);
      const g = makeSprite([
        { m: ell(12 - ex, ey0, er, er), p: P_KURI },
        { m: ell(12 + ex, ey0, er, er), p: P_KURI },
        { m: ell(12, cy, rx, ry), p: P_KURI }
      ], g => {
        const yCap = Math.floor(top + 3.6 * k);
        for (let y = Math.max(0, Math.floor(top)); y <= yCap; y++) {
          for (let x = 0; x < GW; x++) {
            if (inner(g, x, y, P_KURI.o) && Math.abs(x - 11.5) <= 6.2 * k) {
              g[y][x] = y === yCap ? P_CHEST.s : P_CHEST.b;
            }
          }
        }
      });
      const off = st === 'adult' ? 4 : 3, h = st === 'baby' ? 2 : 3, ey = Math.floor(cy) - 1;
      return Object.assign({ g, o: P_KURI.o }, face(off, h, ey, ey + h + 1, -1, st === 'baby' ? 1 : 2));
    },
    momonga(st) {
      const k = K[st], rx = 7.8 * k, ry = 7.0 * k, cy = 22 - ry, top = cy - ry;
      const ex = 5.2 * k, ey0 = top + 0.8 * k, er = Math.max(2.0, 2.7 * k);
      const g = makeSprite([
        { m: ell(12 + 5.6 * k, cy + 0.5, 4.2 * k, 6.2 * k), p: P_TAIL },
        { m: ell(12 - ex, ey0, er, er * 1.15), p: P_WHITE },
        { m: ell(12 + ex - 0.5, ey0, er, er * 1.15), p: P_WHITE },
        { m: ell(11.5, cy, rx, ry), p: P_WHITE }
      ], g => {
        const py = Math.round(ey0), lx = Math.round(12 - ex), rx0 = Math.round(11 + ex);
        if (inner(g, lx, py, P_WHITE.o)) g[py][lx] = '#89B8D6';
        if (inner(g, rx0, py, P_WHITE.o)) g[py][rx0] = '#89B8D6';
        const fy = Math.floor(top + 2.5 * k);
        if (inner(g, 11, fy, P_WHITE.o)) g[fy][11] = '#A8D4E6';
        if (inner(g, 12, fy, P_WHITE.o)) g[fy][12] = '#A8D4E6';
      });
      const off = st === 'adult' ? 4 : 3, h = st === 'baby' ? 2 : 3, ey = Math.floor(cy) - 1;
      return Object.assign({ g, o: P_WHITE.o }, face(off, h, ey, ey + h + 1, -1, st === 'baby' ? 1 : 2));
    },
    rakko(st) {
      const k = K[st], rx = 8.2 * k, ry = 7.3 * k, cy = 22 - ry, top = cy - ry;
      const ex = 5.6 * k, ey0 = top + 1.8 * k, er = Math.max(1.6, 2.2 * k);
      const g = makeSprite([
        { m: ell(12, cy - 0.3, rx + 0.8, ry + 0.6), p: P_MANE },
        { m: ell(12 - ex, ey0, er, er), p: P_RAKKO },
        { m: ell(12 + ex, ey0, er, er), p: P_RAKKO },
        { m: ell(12, cy + 0.3, rx - 0.2, ry - 0.2), p: P_RAKKO }
      ], g => {
        // 오른쪽 이마 십자 흉터
        const sx = Math.round(12 - 3.2 * k), sy = Math.floor(cy - 3.5 * k);
        [[sx, sy], [sx - 1, sy], [sx + 1, sy], [sx, sy - 1], [sx, sy + 1]].forEach(([x, y]) => {
          if (inner(g, x, y, P_RAKKO.o)) g[y][x] = '#C49558';
        });
      });
      const off = st === 'adult' ? 4 : 3, h = st === 'baby' ? 2 : 3, ey = Math.floor(cy) - 1;
      return Object.assign({ g, o: P_RAKKO.o }, face(off, h, ey, ey + h + 1, -1, st === 'baby' ? 1 : 2));
    },
    shisa(st) {
      const k = K[st], rx = 7.6 * k, ry = 6.8 * k, cy = 22 - ry, top = cy - ry;
      const g = makeSprite([
        { m: ell(12, cy - 0.5, rx + 1.8 * k, ry + 1.2 * k), p: P_MANE },
        { m: ell(12 - 4.5 * k, top + 0.5, 2.2 * k, 2.2 * k), p: P_MANE },
        { m: ell(12 + 4.5 * k, top + 0.5, 2.2 * k, 2.2 * k), p: P_MANE },
        { m: ell(12, cy + 0.4, rx, ry - 0.3), p: P_WHITE }
      ], g => {
        // 늠름한 눈썹 포인트
        const by = Math.floor(cy - 3.2 * k);
        if (inner(g, 8, by, P_WHITE.o)) g[by][8] = '#66412B';
        if (inner(g, 15, by, P_WHITE.o)) g[by][15] = '#66412B';
      });
      const off = st === 'adult' ? 4 : 3, h = st === 'baby' ? 2 : 3, ey = Math.floor(cy) - 1;
      return Object.assign({ g, o: P_WHITE.o }, face(off, h, ey, ey + h + 1, -1, st === 'baby' ? 1 : 2));
    }
  };

  const META = {
    chiikawa: {
      name: '치이카와', sub: '만작귀',
      born: '치이카와가 태어났어! 작고 소중한 친구야',
      desc: '골고루 다정하게 돌봐주면',
      ink: '#2A2224', bl: '#F4A6A8',
      lines: ['와…! 으와…', '에…?!', '열심히 할게…!', '초코비 먹고 싶다…', '오늘도 화이팅…!']
    },
    hachiware: {
      name: '하치와레', sub: '턱시도고양이',
      born: '하치와레가 태어났어! 명랑하고 든든한 친구야',
      desc: '자주 쓰다듬어주면',
      ink: '#222834', bl: '#F4A6A8',
      lines: ['어라? 이거 말이지~', '찰칵! 사진 찍자!', '어떻게든 되겠지!', '같이 힘내자구!', '차루메라 끓여 먹을까?']
    },
    usagi: {
      name: '우사기', sub: '토끼',
      born: '우사기가 태어났어! 우라ー! 활기찬 자유영혼이야',
      desc: '신나게 많이 놀아주면',
      ink: '#32281E', bl: '#F4A6A8',
      lines: ['우라ー!', '야하ー!!', '푸루루루~!', '하ァ?', '신나게 놀자구!']
    },
    kurimanju: {
      name: '쿠리만쥬', sub: '밤만쥬',
      born: '쿠리만쥬가 태어났어! 여유와 맛을 아는 친구야',
      desc: '밥을 든든히 챙겨주면',
      ink: '#34241A', bl: '#F2A098',
      lines: ['하ー… (크으~)', '맛있는 간식 시간!', '커피 한 모금 어때?', '여유롭게 가자구~']
    },
    momonga: {
      name: '모몽가', sub: '하늘다람쥐',
      born: '모몽가가 태어났어! 당당하게 귀여움을 뽐내는 친구야',
      desc: '도도하게 두거나 간식을 주면',
      ink: '#242B35', bl: '#F4A6A8',
      lines: ['칭찬해 줘ー!', '맛있는 거 내놔!', '봐봐, 나 귀엽지?', '얼른 쓰다듬어 봐!']
    },
    rakko: {
      name: '라꼬', sub: '해달',
      born: '라꼬 선배가 태어났어! 달콤한 걸 좋아하는 토벌 랭커야',
      desc: '할 일·집중을 열심히 하면',
      ink: '#32261E', bl: '#F2A29E',
      lines: ['방심하지 마라!', '끝나고 파르페 먹으러 갈까…', '업무 토벌도 완벽하군!', '특훈이다! 같이 집중하자']
    },
    shisa: {
      name: '시사', sub: '사자',
      born: '시사가 태어났어! 아르바이트도 공부도 성실한 노력파야',
      desc: '휴식과 돌봄을 꼼꼼히 챙기면',
      ink: '#32241B', bl: '#F4A6A8',
      lines: ['오키나와 소바 드실래요~?', '오늘도 성실하게 일해요!', '자격증 공부도 화이팅!', '스승님처럼 멋지게 해낼 거예요!']
    }
  };

  const ORDER = ['chiikawa', 'hachiware', 'usagi', 'kurimanju', 'momonga', 'rakko', 'shisa'];

  const SPR = {};
  for (const sp of ORDER) {
    SPR[sp] = {};
    for (const st of STAGES) {
      const s = BUILD[sp](st);
      let bottom = 0;
      for (let y = 0; y < GW; y++) if (s.g[y].some(Boolean)) bottom = y;
      s.bottom = bottom;
      SPR[sp][st] = s;
    }
  }

  const EGGP = {
    neutral:   { o: '#9B8B6E', b: '#FBF4E4', h: '#FFFFFF', s: '#EADFC6', sp: '#EFE3C8' },
    random:    { o: '#7A688E', b: '#F8F2FC', h: '#FFFFFF', s: '#E5D6F2', sp: '#C39CE3' },
    chiikawa:  { o: '#8E6D74', b: '#FFF6F8', h: '#FFFFFF', s: '#F4DEE3', sp: '#F4A6A8' },
    hachiware: { o: '#4A6E94', b: '#F4F9FF', h: '#FFFFFF', s: '#DCEAF8', band: '#4B8EC8' },
    usagi:     { o: '#947B4A', b: '#FFF6D6', h: '#FFFFF0', s: '#F0DFAA', sp: '#E8C468' },
    kurimanju: { o: '#6E4832', b: '#FDF0D5', h: '#FFF9EC', s: '#EBD5AD', band: '#7A4E36' },
    momonga:   { o: '#5B7E91', b: '#F0FAFD', h: '#FFFFFF', s: '#D4EDF4', sp: '#9AD0E2' },
    rakko:     { o: '#7D6852', b: '#FBF3E4', h: '#FFFFFF', s: '#E8D8BE', sp: '#C99F6B' },
    shisa:     { o: '#7A4E2D', b: '#FFF1E0', h: '#FFFDF9', s: '#EDD4B8', band: '#8C583A' }
  };
  const eggMask = (x, y) => { const dy = y - 14, ry = 8.5, t = dy < 0 ? -dy / ry : 0, rx = 6.8 * (1 - 0.22 * t); return ((x - 12) / rx) ** 2 + (dy / ry) ** 2 <= 1; };
  const EGG = {};
  for (const key in EGGP) {
    const p = EGGP[key];
    EGG[key] = makeSprite([{ m: eggMask, p }], g => {
      if (p.sp) [[9, 9], [14, 10], [11, 13], [16, 15], [8, 16], [13, 18], [10, 20], [15, 20], [12, 8]].forEach(([x, y]) => { if (inner(g, x, y, p.o)) g[y][x] = p.sp; });
      if (p.band) for (let y = 14; y <= 15; y++) for (let x = 0; x < GW; x++) if (inner(g, x, y, p.o)) g[y][x] = p.band;
    });
  }
  const HINT = {
    neutral:   '아직 어떤 친구일지 두근두근해',
    random:    '랜덤 부화! 누구와 만나게 될까?',
    chiikawa:  '작고 포근한 치이카와의 기운이 느껴져',
    hachiware: '다정하고 명랑한 하치와레의 기운이 느껴져',
    usagi:     '어디선가 우라ー! 신나는 기운이 느껴져',
    kurimanju: '구수한 밤만쥬 향기가 나는 것 같아',
    momonga:   '복슬복슬하고 당돌한 기운이 느껴져',
    rakko:     '든든하고 비장한 토벌 랭커의 기운이 느껴져',
    shisa:     '부지런하고 성실한 기운이 느껴져'
  };

  // 첨부 도트 이미지 기반 7종 x 5표정 고해상도 스프라이트 (base64 PNG)
  const IMG_DATA = {"chiikawa": {"normal": "data:image/png;base64,", "joy": "data:image/png;base64,", "sleep": "data:image/png;base64,", "sad": "data:image/png;base64,", "eat": "data:image/png;base64,"}, "hachiware": {"normal": "data:image/png;base64,", "joy": "data:image/png;base64,", "sleep": "data:image/png;base64,", "sad": "data:image/png;base64,", "eat": "data:image/png;base64,"}, "usagi": {"normal": "data:image/png;base64,", "joy": "data:image/png;base64,", "sleep": "data:image/png;base64,", "sad": "data:image/png;base64,", "eat": "data:image/png;base64,"}, "kurimanju": {"normal": "data:image/png;base64,", "joy": "data:image/png;base64,", "sleep": "data:image/png;base64,", "sad": "data:image/png;base64,", "eat": "data:image/png;base64,"}, "momonga": {"normal": "data:image/png;base64,", "joy": "data:image/png;base64,", "sleep": "data:image/png;base64,", "sad": "data:image/png;base64,", "eat": "data:image/png;base64,"}, "rakko": {"normal": "data:image/png;base64,", "joy": "data:image/png;base64,", "sleep": "data:image/png;base64,", "sad": "data:image/png;base64,", "eat": "data:image/png;base64,"}, "shisa": {"normal": "data:image/png;base64,", "joy": "data:image/png;base64,", "sleep": "data:image/png;base64,", "sad": "data:image/png;base64,", "eat": "data:image/png;base64,"}};
  const IMGS = {};
  if (typeof Image !== 'undefined') {
    for (const sp of ORDER) {
      IMGS[sp] = {};
      for (const ex of ['normal', 'joy', 'sleep', 'sad', 'eat']) {
        const img = new Image();
        img.src = IMG_DATA[sp][ex];
        IMGS[sp][ex] = img;
      }
    }
  }

  const api = { GW, STAGES, K, SPR, META, ORDER, EGG, EGGP, HINT, IMG_DATA, IMGS };
  if (typeof module !== 'undefined' && module.exports) module.exports = api;
  else root.Sprites = api;
})(typeof window !== 'undefined' ? window : globalThis);
